This package ports the library core of Venn (venn-vdm 0.1.0, commit
7b2042e84608fbdd143ac21dea7c83d5ae2ec723) to TypeScript: its decision heads,
its question types, its families and its comparisons of stored vectors. The
package does not include Venn's Python code.

- Venn: Copyright (c) 2026 Venn contributors, MIT License,
  https://github.com/markrussinovich/venn-vdm.

The package does not ship model weights. At run time it downloads the venn-1
decision head (https://huggingface.co/markrussinovich/venn-1, revision
e618a6919e5a15c6ced46c9874424363c2955283), whose model card permits
redistribution, and it reads vectors of the EmbeddingGemma 2 reader
(https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2, Apache License 2.0).
